00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:10.800
you won a grant? What's the
screenplay about? Yvan Iturriaga, Filmmaker (The North Pole TV Series): American Babylon takes

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:17.850
place in 2001 the summer of 2001 and it
follows 26 year-old exile from Chile. I

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:23.430
don't know how I came up with it and he
he mostly just wants to ignore the world

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:27.930
around him and be happy and chill
and take care of his sick uncle who's a

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:34.770
ex-revolutionary from Chile who is kind
of this if he recycles he builds crosses

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:40.559
for the church he stays that he's kind
of this hermit. And the main character

00:00:40.559 --> 00:00:46.500
also barters weed so he lives in this
underground economy but it's um

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.539
bartering and his girlfriend
Satya (a black girl from Oakland) who goes

00:00:51.539 --> 00:00:56.489
to University of California at Berkeley, studies history,
she's an activist and she is organizing a march

00:00:56.489 --> 00:01:00.420
so she's always pushing him to care and
to get involved in the world around him

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:05.129
back in 2001 you know Bush had just
stolen the elections and Oakland was up

00:01:05.129 --> 00:01:10.290
in arms and there was huge marches
against globalization so the world was

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:16.080
very active and so my film is like
dealing with that world and pushing our

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:21.900
main character to care but he avoids it
until his uncle gets sick he can't

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.650
afford it take care of him he's forced
to switch from bartering to selling weed

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:30.659
kind of breaking his his mode of
operating in the world eventually the

00:01:30.659 --> 00:01:35.820
march of the girlfriend organizes riot
police shut it down it's a peaceful

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:40.290
march but she gets hit and arrested and
taken away for a while and all these

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:44.909
things trigger the main characters
memories of his parents being hurt in

00:01:44.909 --> 00:01:49.380
a dictatorship in Chile and so these
these dreams last nightmares start

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:53.430
reoccurring and pushing him and he ends
up kind of breaking and joining the

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:57.899
